From a072a15272a9088c2f4e8ffa252a084bce28362e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: riceharvest <myappleiddarimaan@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 22:53:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 25/51] B70-V6x: riceharvest draft int4 MTP lane + 64K draft
 vocab (default off, B70_DRAFT_LMHEAD_INT4 / B70_DRAFT_MTP_INT4 /
 B70_DRAFT_VOCAB)

Folds four riceharvest/vllm b70/v0.32 commits for the Qwen3.5/3.8 built-in
MTP draft (qwen3_5_mtp), each off unless its env is set:

1. 85c7f2e937 patch_mtp_nightly: B70_MTP_BF16_DRAFT=1 builds the MTP layers
   unquantized (prerequisite for the int4 draft on a quantized checkpoint;
   also brings `import os`).
2. 5abe51fbda patch_draft_lmhead_int4: B70_DRAFT_LMHEAD_INT4=1 quantizes the
   draft lm_head once to GPTQ INT4 g128 sym and routes draft logits through
   torch.ops._xpu_C.int4_gemm_w4a16. TP1 only (fail-closed above).
3. 552632bc85 patch_draft_mtp_int4: B70_DRAFT_MTP_INT4=1 quantizes the five
   MTP linears to INT4 g128 sym after load_weights.
4. a23cc416a2 patch_draft_vocab: B70_DRAFT_VOCAB=<json> makes the INT4 draft
   head score only a token subset (the target verifies on the full vocab).

B70-V6x additions on top:
- B70_DRAFT_VOCAB=64k resolves to the bundled subset
  vllm/model_executor/models/b70_draft_vocab_64k.json (65536 ids, max 248076,
  from riceharvest/b70-qwen38-cookbook runtime/draft_vocab_64k.json @e559844,
  MIT); added to setup.py package_data.
- Fail-closed guards: the draft head INT4 skips an lm_head that is not a plain
  2-D fp16/bf16 weight (B70_HEAD_FP8 / B70_HEAD_INT8 own it), and the MTP INT4
  skips linears that are not plain fp16/bf16 (W8A8 / GPTQ drafter).

Not GPU-tested here (CPU py_compile only).

Generated from patches/sergiiob/patch_mtp_nightly.py,
patches/sergiiob/patch_draft_lmhead_int4.py,
patches/sergiiob/patch_draft_mtp_int4.py and patches/b70/patch_draft_vocab.py
of riceharvest/b70-qwen38-cookbook@9f7fa83.

